<title>USA: Low inflation key to low interest rates - Greenspan.</title>
<headline>Low inflation key to low interest rates - Greenspan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The lower inflation and the smaller the budget deficit, the lower that interest rates can be, Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He made the comment to the House Budget Committee.</p>
</text>
